sameBits purpose "Whether a double has the expected bits"
sameBits invariant none
sameBits typeParameter none
sameBits input expected UInt64 copied
sameBits input actual Float64 copied
sameBits output Bool
sameBits outputOwnedBy none
sameBits raises none
sameBits effect none
sameBits uses none
sameBits memoryHeap false
sameBits async false
sameBits maxRecursion none
sameBits label begin loopKind none
sameBits label begin within none
sameBits let none
sameBits at begin do readActualBits
sameBits at begin do findSame1
sameBits at begin return ok same

